'''''Astragalus glaux''''' is a species of [[milk vetch|milkvetch]] in the family [[Fabaceae]], native to the western Mediterranean.<ref name="POWO_477625-1" >{{cite POWO |id=477625-1 |title=''Astragalus glaux'' L. |access-date=12 December 2022 }}</ref> It is a [[camephyte]].<ref>{{cite journal |title=Assessing vulnerability of listed Mediterranean plants based on population monitoring |year=2019 |last1=Gauthier |first1=Perrine |last2=Pons |first2=Virginie |last3=Fisogni |first3=Alessandro |last4=Murru |first4=Valentina |last5=Berjano |first5=Regina |last6=Dessena |first6=Simone |last7=MacCioni |first7=Alfredo |last8=Chelo |first8=Chiara |last9=De Manincor |first9=Natasha |last10=Doncieux |first10=Antoine |last11=Papuga |first11=Guillaume |last12=Thompson |first12=John D. |journal=Journal for Nature Conservation |volume=52 |article-number=125758 |s2cid=209576412 |url=https://hal.archives-ouvertes.fr/hal-02984123/file/Gauthier%20et%20al%202019b.pdf |doi=10.1016/j.jnc.2019.125758 |bibcode=2019JNatC..5225758G }}</ref>

